WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
Your brain helps you feel pain.

2
00:00:01.645 --> 00:00:04.780
But brain tissue itself has no pain sensors.

3
00:00:04.745 --> 00:00:06.830
The lining and nerves around it are different.

4
00:00:07.225 --> 00:00:08.400
Look closer at the lining.

5
00:00:08.365 --> 00:00:10.640
It has pain-sensitive nerve endings.

6
00:00:10.605 --> 00:00:11.840
When these nerves are activated,

7
00:00:11.805 --> 00:00:13.710
they send a message toward the brain.

8
00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:15.580
The message reaches your brain,

9
00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:17.660
which processes it as pain.

10
00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:20.180
That’s why a headache can feel deep inside your head,

11
00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.860
even when the signal started in nearby tissue.

12
00:00:22.825 --> 00:00:24.110
Different headaches have different causes.
